{"language":"cn","values":[["/names/cn","梅希拉"],["/description_i18n/cn","一名诡惑人心的恶魔，操纵敌人的欲望和自己的眷属来支配敌人。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","欲望，并非虚妄。"],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","My desire is real."],["/unit_voice_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","你知道我很难满足的。呵呵……这就对了。"],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","I'm- hard to please."],["/unit_voice_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","用欲望————满足我吧……！"],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_i18n/en","The ache of longing quench it."],["/unit_voice_lines/2/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/text_i18n/cn","糟糕……陷得太深了……"],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_i18n/en","I let you... get too close..."],["/unit_voice_lines/3/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/text_i18n/cn","让我们随心所欲地狂欢吧。"],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_i18n/en","Let's celebrate. Just you and me."],["/unit_voice_lines/4/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/text_i18n/cn","我爱你，来吧，来爱我吧"],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_i18n/en","All I need is your love and desire."],["/unit_voice_lines/5/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","嗯……？别害羞，靠近点。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_i18n/en","Don't be shy I won't bite."],["/resonating_hall_lines/0/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","梅林……哼。"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_i18n/en","Are you going to stand me up again, Merlin?"],["/resonating_hall_lines/1/transcript_source_i18n/en","manual"],["/affinity_gift_lines/0/text_i18n/cn","嗯嗯……就是这样，我还想要更多哦。"],["/affinity_gift_lines/1/text_i18n/cn","哎呀，你还可以做得更好吧？"],["/affinity_gift_lines/2/text_i18n/cn","该罚你做什么好呢？"],["/skins/0/name_i18n/cn","诡惑女王"],["/skins/0/description_i18n/cn","面对致命的欲望，人们总是明知故犯。"],["/skins/1/name_i18n/cn","纯白恶念"],["/skins/1/description_i18n/cn","将纯白，染上欲望的颜色。"],["/skins/1/acquisition_i18n/cn","金玫瑰高定商店兑换获得。"],["/skins/1/quality_i18n/cn","传说"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/0/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","凡人的食物真是无趣"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/0/text_i18n/cn","有欲望的味道……"],["/mystical_house_idle_dialogue/1/lines/1/text_i18n/cn","有趣的家伙在哪？"],["/affinity_tales/0/text_i18n/cn","梅希拉是最危险的恶魔之一，鲜少有人能抵抗住她的诱惑。"],["/affinity_tales/1/text_i18n/cn","梅希拉的甜言蜜语皆是出于真心，正如她坚信人们会为她献出一切。"],["/affinity_tales/2/text_i18n/cn","梅希拉不明白人们为何会对她充满敌意：她能提供梦寐以求的极致体验，这不好吗？"],["/affinity_tales/3/text_i18n/cn","那些被梅希拉吻过的人，光芒渐散的眼中往往还残留着对她的痴迷。"],["/affinity_tales/4/text_i18n/cn","梅希拉的每一只眷属都有名字，它们都来自她曾诱惑过的人，会为梅希拉奉献生命——但梅希拉从来不会缺少新的眷属。"],["/affinity_tales/5/text_i18n/cn","在梅希拉精妙的幻象中，人们会将她认成自己最想见到的人，不自觉地向她走去。"],["/affinity_tales/6/text_i18n/cn","传说梅希拉的亲吻可以融化世间万物，同为恶魔的蒂斯妮娅对此不置可否——至少她的寒冰不会。"],["/affinity_tales/7/text_i18n/cn","梅希拉喜欢一种紫黑色的花，因其外形像是倒挂的丧钟，甜美多汁的浆果只需两颗就能让人毙命，是她最爱的零食。"],["/affinity_tales/8/text_i18n/cn","“纯粹的欢愉在我心中绽放，她就是梦想本身，她就是我的唯一真爱……”——某位圣堂神父临终前为梅希拉所写的“赞歌”，此人已因堕落而被圣堂制裁。"],["/affinity_tales/9/text_i18n/cn","据传，为了弄清梅林为何不受她的诱惑，梅希拉曾在某次无法查证的恶魔聚会上表示，她愿意给梅林当三百年仆人，以换取其中的奥秘。"],["/interaction_records/0/preview_i18n/cn","可惜，何等可惜！只差一厘，你就是完美的形态！"],["/interaction_records/0/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415709.json"],["/interaction_records/0/title_i18n/cn","雷内亚 & 梅希拉"],["/interaction_records/1/preview_i18n/cn","凡人的食物真是无趣"],["/interaction_records/1/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415723.json"],["/interaction_records/1/title_i18n/cn","梅希拉"],["/interaction_records/2/preview_i18n/cn","有欲望的味道……"],["/interaction_records/2/locales/cn","locales/cn/mn/herohub_story/10415724.json"],["/interaction_records/2/title_i18n/cn","梅希拉"]]}